arning): each soul history record cites two resolving links or one `defining: true` event.\n- `review-due` (info): never reviewed, or `review_every_days` passed.\n- `kb` (error for an unknown project or malformed link; warning for a missing file or section): `[[kb:<p>:<path>#<Section>]]` links. A KB folder that is not on disk is skipped, so identities lint clean on machines without the project checked out.\n","path":"lint.md","projectPath":"lat.md/lint.md","frontmatter":{},"sections":[{"id":"lat.md/lint#Lint","heading":"Lint","depth":1,"file":"lat.md/lint","filePath":"lat.md/lint.md","children":[{"id":"lat.md/lint#Lint#Rules","heading":"Rules","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/lint","filePath":"lat.md/lint.md","children":[],"startLine":5,"endLine":25,"firstParagraph":"Each rule has a code usable with `--rule`.","githubSlug":"rules"}],"startLine":1,"endLine":4,"firstParagraph":"`owo lint` checks one identity. Errors fail the run with exit 1; warnings and infos report only.","githubSlug":"lint"}],"headingTitles":["Lint","Rules"],"wikiRefs":[{"target":"formats#Entry frontmatter","fromSection":"lat.md/lint#Lint#Rules","file":"lat.md/lint","line":10}],"paragraphs":[{"markdown":"`owo lint` checks one identity. Errors fail the run with exit 1; warnings and infos report only.","startLine":3,"endLine":3,"text":"owo lint checks one identity. Errors fail the run with exit 1; warnings and infos report only."},{"markdown":"Each rule has a code usable with `--rule`.","startLine":7,"endLine":7,"text":"Each rule has a code usable with --rule."},{"markdown":"`tree` (error): required files and folders; `identity.json` schema `owo/1` and slug; SoulSpec required fields; location folders have `overview.md`, slug names, one level deep; files outside the layout; Markdown files that are not valid UTF-8 (owo reads them with U+FFFD in place of the bad bytes, and `owo stamp` refuses to run until they are fixed).","startLine":9,"endLine":9,"text":"tree (error): required files and folders; identity.json